# Forest OS: Public Repository .gitignore
# Everything is ignored by default: we explicitly include only public core files

# Ignore all:
# This repo only contains the Forest OS core protocol + automation scripts
# Personal coursework, private vault data, and large binaries are out-of-scope

# Temporarily ignore everything
/*
# But include these top-level directories:
!00_Core_Protocols/
!01_Docs/
!02_Agent_Definitions/
!03_Automation_Scripts/
!04_Configuration/
!05_Tests/
!Documentation/
!README.md

# Include inner Forest_OS workspace (active development)
!Forest_OS/

# Inside included dirs: include all files recursively
!00_Core_Protocols/**
!01_Docs/**
!02_Agent_Definitions/**
!03_Automation_Scripts/**
!04_Configuration/**
!05_Tests/**
!Documentation/**
!Forest_OS/**

# Exclude private/volarile things inside included dirs
# (compost, event logs, large binaries)
Forest_OS/Events/**/*
Forest_OS/Events/*.json
!Forest_OS/Events/.gitkeep

# No .gitignore itself
!.gitignore

# Python artifacts and caches
**/__pycache__/**
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/

# Databases, vector stores, and execution logs
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log
*.vec

